FROM golang:1.26-alpine@sha256:30b1e546a9c7fa3b747c2bdba3a0c7bdf3a02ebb4c5b8405d2f948d7e8aac4ec AS build
WORKDIR /src
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download
COPY . .
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -trimpath -o /out/api ./cmd/api

# Distroless: no shell, no package manager, runs as non-root (uid 65532).
# The Docker health check calls `/api healthcheck` because there is no wget.
FROM gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot@sha256:afa5c872c891853ca7fcf1f12c3edb23f7eeef36189728842dd51042ff57f7ab
COPY --from=build /out/api /api
EXPOSE 8080
ENTRYPOINT ["/api"]
